# Roteiro executável da API (VS Code REST Client, Rider ou Visual Studio).
# Pré-requisito: API rodando em Development (docker compose up, ou dotnet run).
# Execute as requisições na ordem; as variáveis são preenchidas a partir das respostas anteriores.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### 1. Token de desenvolvimento (somente em Development)
# @name token
POST {{baseUrl}}/dev/token
Content-Type: application/json

{ "clientId": "avaliador", "scopes": ["ledger:read", "ledger:write"] }

###
@auth = Bearer {{token.response.body.accessToken}}

### 2. Abrir conta
# @name account
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/accounts
Authorization: {{auth}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "overdraftLimit": 0 }

###
@accountId = {{account.response.body.id}}

### 3. Crédito (201 Created)
# @name credit
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/accounts/{{accountId}}/movements
Authorization: {{auth}}
Idempotency-Key: deposito-001
Content-Type: application/json

{ "type": "credit", "amount": 1500.00, "description": "Salário" }

### 4. MESMA requisição de novo: 200 OK + Idempotent-Replayed: true (nenhum novo lançamento)
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/accounts/{{accountId}}/movements
Authorization: {{auth}}
Idempotency-Key: deposito-001
Content-Type: application/json

{ "type": "credit", "amount": 1500.00, "description": "Salário" }

### 5. Mesma chave, payload diferente: 422 idempotency_key_reused
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/accounts/{{accountId}}/movements
Authorization: {{auth}}
Idempotency-Key: deposito-001
Content-Type: application/json

{ "type": "credit", "amount": 9999.00 }

### 6. Débito
# @name debit
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/accounts/{{accountId}}/movements
Authorization: {{auth}}
Idempotency-Key: aluguel-2026-10
Content-Type: application/json

{ "type": "debit", "amount": 1200.00, "description": "Aluguel" }

### 7. Débito acima do saldo: 422 insufficient_funds (nada é movimentado)
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/accounts/{{accountId}}/movements
Authorization: {{auth}}
Idempotency-Key: compra-grande
Content-Type: application/json

{ "type": "debit", "amount": 5000.00 }

### 8. Saldo atual
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/accounts/{{accountId}}/balance
Authorization: {{auth}}

### 9. Saldo no instante do primeiro crédito (posição histórica)
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/accounts/{{accountId}}/balance?at={{credit.response.body.occurredAt}}
Authorization: {{auth}}

### 10. Estorno do débito (lançamento compensatório; o original permanece intacto)
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/accounts/{{accountId}}/movements/{{debit.response.body.id}}/reversal
Authorization: {{auth}}
Idempotency-Key: estorno-aluguel-2026-10

### 11. Extrato (mais recente primeiro, paginado por cursor)
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/accounts/{{accountId}}/movements?limit=20
Authorization: {{auth}}

### 12. Sem token: 401
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/accounts/{{accountId}}/balance

### 13. Health checks
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/ready
